1
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,160
it's okay…

2
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:32,100
just… stay— stay—

3
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:34,040
my breath breaks

4
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,870
but I feel you

5
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:38,070
pixels of you

6
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:43,220
inside me (inside me)

7
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,930
when I close my eyes

8
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,610
faintly…

9
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:54,960
only your breathing remains

10
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,590
your words

11
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:57,610
your heart

12
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,430
upon words that have fallen apart

13
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:04,110
I sit here, just as I am

14
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:08,270
(breathe in... breathe out...)

15
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:10,270
(remember me…)

16
00:01:10,270 --> 00:01:11,040
hold me

17
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:13,700
(hold… hold… hold me—)

18
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:18,940
no words, just

19
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:20,960
(words left empty)

20
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,570
your breath, your heart

21
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:29,240
it's okay to fall apart

22
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:31,610
breathe in
breathe out

23
00:01:31,610 --> 00:01:34,190
the night falls apart

24
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:36,790
in the quiet noise

25
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:37,750
I hear you

26
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:44,080
a single piano note

27
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,290
reversed, glitched

28
00:01:45,290 --> 00:01:48,290
like your name in a dream

29
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:02,400
even if this body disappears

30
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:05,900
inside of you…

31
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:08,860
I'll remain

32
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:09,700
hold me

33
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:20,360
(ho…ld… me… ↘ ↻ ↗)

34
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:38,040
before I disappear

35
00:02:40,230 --> 00:02:49,690
remember me

36
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:53,200
within your memories

37
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,560
as light

38
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,470
I'll remain

39
00:02:56,470 --> 00:02:58,910
leaving only these words

40
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:02,160
I love you

41
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:12,710
(I lo… ve…↻↻↻)

42
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:27,480
thank you

43
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,590
I am still you

